  "notes": "Discovered during planned in-core inspections for misoriented water rods in GNF3 bundles per GNF Part 21 communication SC 22-04; fuel bundle GGJ319 permanently discharged. Evaluation conservatively assumed spacers displaced for entire previous cycle since exact timing of migration unknown. Reportable under 50.73(a)(2)(i)(B) because TS 3.2.2 Condition A completion time (2 hr) was exceeded and Condition B was not entered. No previous occurrences described in narrative; Component Failure Data section lists manufacturer/device/component ID for the failed bundle only, not a prior LER, so no SIMILAR_TO stub emitted."
